        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Phoenix, Shearwater, Strange Talk\n- People: Thomas Mars, Deck d'Arcy, Christian Mazzalai, Laurent Brancowitz, Jonathan Meiburg\n- Places: Versailles, France, Austin, Texas\n- Topics: indie pop, indie rock, musical comparisons\n\nFacts:\n- Phoenix is an indie pop band from Versailles, France.\n- Phoenix consists of Thomas Mars, Deck d'Arcy, Christian Mazzalai, and Laurent Brancowitz.\n- Thomas Mars is the lead vocalist of Phoenix.\n- Deck d'Arcy plays bass and keyboards and provides backing vocals for Phoenix.\n- Christian Mazzalai plays guitar and keyboards and provides backing vocals for Phoenix.\n- Laurent Brancowitz plays guitar and provides backing vocals for Phoenix.\n- Shearwater is an American indie rock band from Austin, Texas.\n- Jonathan Meiburg leads Shearwater and is its multi-instrumentalist and lead singer.\n- Jonathan Meiburg is a singer-songwriter.\n- In 2010, Strange Talk was formed.\n- The sound of Strange Talk has been likened to Cut Copy, Passion Pit, Phoenix, and Yeasayer.",
